            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\n*Technically* it is possible, of course. I'd really like to avoid increasing the size of the 'mini.pick' code, though. And this method is indeed only meant as a fallback, i.e. \"use only if other ways fail\". In this particular case it *highly recommended* to install `ripgrep` CLI tool for `files`, `grep`, and `grep_live`.\n\nI'll close this as \"not planned\" for the time being. But this is not a very strong opinion, though.",
